sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Router as FastAPI Router
    participant Manager as Manager Agent
    participant Tool as Tool Agent
    participant MCP as OXII MCP Server
    participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Pro

    Note over User,LLM: Case 5: Single Device Control<br/>"Turn on the Fan in the living room"<br/>Total Time: ~23s

    %% === REQUEST & ROUTING ===
    User->>+Router: POST /ai/chat/text<br/>"Turn on the Fan in the living room."
    Note over Router: 2025-11-02 06:10:04

    Router->>+Manager: Process request
    
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Manager,LLM: 🔍 ANALYZE & ROUTE
        Manager->>+LLM: Analyze query
        Note over LLM: Intent: device control (single fan)<br/>⏱️ ~6s
        LLM-->>-Manager: {<br/>  agent_type: "tool",<br/>  confidence: 1.00,<br/>  reasoning: "User wants to control<br/>  a specific device"<br/>}
        Note over Manager: 🎯 Routing to Tool Agent
    end

    Manager->>+Tool: Initialize & delegate<br/>{input, token}
    Note over Tool: 🔧 Tool Agent loaded<br/>with MCP client

    %% === TOOL AGENT LANGGRAPH FLOW ===
    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over Tool,LLM: 🔄 LangGraph StateGraph Execution
        
        Tool->>Tool: __start__ node<br/>Initialize state
        Note over Tool: iteration: 0<br/>max_iterations: 5
        
        %% ITERATION 1: GET DEVICE LIST
        rect rgb(240, 250, 240)
            Note over Tool,LLM: 📍 ITERATION 1: Get Device Information
            
            Tool->>+LLM: reason node<br/>"Turn on the Fan in the living room."
            Note over LLM: Analyze: Need device information<br/>Plan: get_device_list → control<br/>⏱️ ~13s
            LLM-->>-Tool: tool_calls: [<br/>  {name: "get_device_list",<br/>   args: {token}}]
            
            Tool->>Tool: execute node<br/>Phase 2a: prerequisite tool
            Tool->>+MCP: Create fresh MCP client<br/>SSE connect
            MCP-->>-Tool: session_id: 6e0f1615...
            
            Tool->>+MCP: call_tool("get_device_list", {token})
            Note over MCP: Query OXII API<br/>⏱️ ~2s
            MCP-->>-Tool: Device list (1359 chars):<br/>[{<br/>  house_id: 1,<br/>  room_id: 101,<br/>  room_name: "Phòng khách",<br/>  buttons: [<br/>    {buttonId: 1001, name: "Quạt điện",<br/>     type: "FAN", status: "tắt"},<br/>    ...<br/>  ]<br/>}]
            
            Tool->>Tool: Cleanup MCP client
            Note over Tool: ✅ get_device_list completed<br/>iteration: 1
        end
        
        %% ITERATION 2: CONTROL FAN
        rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
            Note over Tool,LLM: 📍 ITERATION 2: Control Fan Device
            
            Tool->>+LLM: reason node (iteration 2)<br/>with device list result
            Note over LLM: Parse device list<br/>Find buttonId for "Quạt điện"<br/>Plan control call<br/>⏱️ ~3s
            LLM-->>-Tool: tool_calls: [<br/>  {name: "switch_on_off_controls_v2",<br/>   args: {<br/>     token,<br/>     buttonId: 1001,<br/>     data: 1<br/>   }}]
            
            Tool->>Tool: execute node<br/>Phase 2a: prerequisite tool
            Tool->>+MCP: Create fresh MCP client<br/>SSE connect
            MCP-->>-Tool: session_id: unique...
            
            Tool->>+MCP: call_tool(<br/>  "switch_on_off_controls_v2",<br/>  {token, buttonId: 1001, data: 1})
            Note over MCP: Send ON command to fan<br/>⏱️ ~1s
            MCP-->>-Tool: {"success": true,<br/> "message": "Command sent"}
            
            Tool->>Tool: Cleanup MCP client
            Note over Tool: ✅ Control command completed<br/>iteration: 2
        end
        
        %% ITERATION 3: SYNTHESIZE RESPONSE
        rect rgb(250, 255, 250)
            Note over Tool,LLM: 📍 ITERATION 3: Final Response
            
            Tool->>+LLM: reason node (iteration 3)<br/>with control result
            Note over LLM: Synthesize user-friendly response<br/>⏱️ ~2s
            LLM-->>-Tool: output: "✅ Command to turn on the<br/>Fan in the living room sent<br/>successfully"<br/>tool_calls: []
            
            Note over Tool: 🏁 No more tool calls<br/>Final answer reached
        end
        
        Tool->>Tool: __end__ node
        Note over Tool: ✅ LangGraph execution complete
    end

    Tool-->>-Manager: {<br/>  output: "✅ Command to turn on<br/>    the Fan sent successfully",<br/>  iterations: 3<br/>}

    Manager->>Manager: finalize_response
    Manager-->>-Router: Success response<br/>processing_time: 23s
    Note over Manager: ✅ Request processed

    Router-->>-User: HTTP 200 OK<br/>"✅ Command to turn on the Fan<br/>in the living room sent successfully"

    %% === TIMING BREAKDOWN ===
    Note over User,LLM: ⏱️ Timing Breakdown (Total: ~23s)<br/><br/>• Manager routing: ~6s (LLM)<br/>• Tool Agent init: ~1s<br/>• Iteration 1 (get_device_list): ~15s<br/>  - LLM reasoning: ~13s<br/>  - MCP call: ~2s<br/>• Iteration 2 (control fan): ~4s<br/>  - LLM reasoning: ~3s<br/>  - MCP call: ~1s<br/>• Iteration 3 (synthesize): ~2s (LLM)<br/><br/>💡 Key Pattern:<br/>• Simple Control = Pattern B<br/>• get_device_list (prerequisite)<br/>  → find buttonId<br/>  → control tool<br/>  → synthesize response<br/>• LangGraph reason→execute cycle (3 iterations)<br/>• Fresh MCP client per tool call
